# Claude Code
# The agentic framework runs ONLY on the local machine (Claude never runs on the
# cluster — it drives the cluster remotely via ssh/sbatch). So none of this needs to
# be in git; the cluster only needs the tracked seismo-sbi code + cluster/ templates.
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
cluster/

# Claude-produced staging scripts: backed up privately in the seismo-claude-backup
# repo (mirrored under .claude/_staging/), not part of the public library.
scripts/axisem/
scripts/continuity/

# Test / coverage artefacts
htmlcov/
.coverage
.coverage.*
coverage.xml

# HinetPy / F-net download intermediates (raw win32 chunks + channel tables).
# The fetch_fnet.py adapter routes these to a /data scratch dir; this guards against
# a manual/burst run leaving them under the repo (e.g. scripts/). Never commit them.
*.cnt
*.ch
*.euc.ch

# Local model checkpoints (fetched from the cluster / GitHub release assets, never committed)
ml-checkpoints/
# HinetPy win32 tools tarball — shipped to CI via the assets-v1 release, not the repo
scripts/win32tools.tar.gz